:: Noah Hang Out End Late High Fun [nobr]

/* Intro */
<span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> jumps and runs around you happily and full of energy. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“That was so fun! What should we do next? Oh, we should-!”</span> He begins to happily ramble on and on, having the best time ever. <span style="color:LightGreen">Then, as if a switch inside him had been flipped, he stops in his tracks, yawns loudly, and rubs his eyes. You laugh and ask your little brother if he is feeling a little tired. Afterall, it is getting pretty late.</span> <br>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
        Name: "Player",
        State: {
            Mouth: "Smirk",
            },
        },
        {
        Name: "Noah",
        State: {
            Outfit: $HangOutClothes,
            Eyes: "Tired",
            Mouth: "Frown",
            Blush: 1,
            },
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Nuh-uh.”</span> He shakes his head, now rubbing his eyes with both hands, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Just a little, ahhh, yawny…”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> walks up next to you and leans his head against your side, yawning again. He blinks slowly and his arms begin to sway heavily. You smile at the tuckered-out boy and say that it may be time to get him home, before he passes out. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Mmmm, yeah… maybe…”</span> He yawns again. <span style="color:Pink">Oh, how quickly the boy’s energy disappears.</span> <br>
<br>

<div id="choice">
	<<link "Offer him a piggyback ride<br>">>
    <<replace"#choice">>
        You step in front of <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> and kneel down with your back facing him, offering to let him ride on your back for the walk home. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“No, I’m not…”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> begins to protest, before yet another yawn interrupts him. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Hmmm, okay…”</span> He gets on your back, and you stand up, holding his legs as he wraps his arms around you. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“But I’m not… I’m not… Mmmmm……”</span> <br>
        
         <<set _ad to [
            {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Happy",
                },
            },
            {
            Name: "Noah",
            State: {
                Outfit: $HangOutClothes,
                Eyes: "Closed",
                Blush: 1,
                },
            },
        ]>>
        <<ad _ad>>

        <span style="color:Pink">A moment later, before you’ve really even started your journey home, you hear <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span>’s cute little breathing. The boy had fallen asleep.</span> You walk home in near silence, only the sounds of the town and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span>’s tiny breathe keeping you company. It feels… nice. You can’t really describe it. <span style="color:Pink">But carrying your sleeping little brother home after a day full of fun just makes you smile. This is a memory you’ll keep for a long time.</span> <br>
        <br>
        Once you get back home, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> begins to stir awake, his little nap getting him back some of his energy. You plop him down on the couch and ask him if he enjoyed the ride. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Huh?”</span> He pauses, rubbing his eyes in confusion, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Y- yeah…”</span> He lies down on the couch for a minute in a little ball, keeping his eyes open as his brain tries to figure out what happened. <span style="color:LightGreen">You give him a pat on the head before walking away.</span> <br>
        <br>
        [[Continue|PH Living Room]]
    <</replace>>
    <</link>>
	<<link "Take his hand and walk him home<br>">>
    <<replace"#choice">>
        You take <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> by the hand and tell him to come home with you. The boy nods and begins to follow you, slowly dragging his feet and occasionally stumbling as your grip is the only thing keeping him on his feet. <span style="color:Pink">His tiredness begins to take over and you notice his eyes close, fully relying on your guidance to get him home safely. It feels nice, to have such trust put in you by your little brother. He lets you take control as he dozes off mid-walk.</span> <br>
        
        <<set _ad to [
            {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Happy",
                Eyes: "Tired",
                },
            },
            {
            Name: "Noah",
            State: {
                Outfit: $HangOutClothes,
                Mouth: "Frown",
                Eyes: "Tired",
                Blush: 1,
                },
            },
        ]>>
        <<ad _ad>>

        Nearing home, you ask him how he’s doing, mainly to check if he had actually passed out while walking. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Yeah… I’m…”</span> He doesn’t finish his sentence, causing you to laugh, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Thanks for… hanging out… I love…”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> begins to say before his words drift off into a stutter. <span style="color:Pink">But he doesn’t have to finish his sentence. You know what he means.</span> <br>
        <br>
        Arriving back home, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> immediately passes out on the couch, face first. You’re pretty sure his legs were on the verge of giving out as he begins to quietly snore away. You sit next to him for a minute, patting his cute head, before getting up and moving on. You’re pretty sure <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> will be up and returned to his usual nighttime routine soon. <br>
        <br>
        [[Continue|PH Living Room]]
